      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. If we're looking at \"demographic volatility\" as a metric, how would a data scientist actually quantify that in the model? Like, are we looking at high rates of residential turnover, or things like shifts in ethnic composition or non-citizen populations? I want to make sure the heatmap is accurate so we don't miss areas where tension might be brewing due to these rapid changes.",
